{"3969340": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Bibi & Tina – Ready, Set, Ride!", "steam_appid": 3969340, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3969340/extras/6e756e5f6b0a301d3fdab9ff4b68425d.poster.avif?t=1787733973\" width=780 height=150 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3969340/extras/6e756e5f6b0a301d3fdab9ff4b68425d.webm?t=1787733973\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3969340/extras/6e756e5f6b0a301d3fdab9ff4b68425d.mp4?t=1787733973\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Summer holidays? Adventure time!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No sooner has Bibi returned to Martin's Farm than the next big adventure awaits: the Summer Cup is starting at Falkenstein Castle. Together with Tina and Alex, you compete in exciting riding disciplines – and show what friendship, fairness and a little bit of witchcraft can make possible.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3969340/extras/5671bece190a8ed6ea0ee5704540921f.poster.avif?t=1787733973\" width=780 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3969340/extras/5671bece190a8ed6ea0ee5704540921f.webm?t=1787733973\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3969340/extras/5671bece190a8ed6ea0ee5704540921f.mp4?t=1787733973\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>New: carriage driving!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This has never been seen in a Bibi &amp; Tina game before: Bibi, Tina and Alex have their very own vehicle ready for the Summer Cup. Steer a carriage along country tracks, through flower gates and around tight slalom courses! After all, champions do not only prove themselves in the saddle.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3969340/extras/c64b6ddf19e7d1643ce1aec76b787627.poster.avif?t=1787733973\" width=780 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3969340/extras/c64b6ddf19e7d1643ce1aec76b787627.webm?t=1787733973\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3969340/extras/c64b6ddf19e7d1643ce1aec76b787627.mp4?t=1787733973\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Stephanie wants the cup. At any cost.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Good thing you are not on your own. Stephanie von Schotterburg has her very own ideas about how to win – and the closer the final gets, the clearer her intentions become. Now it is time to show what really matters: friendship and sticking together. And, of course, Bibi’s witch power!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3969340/extras/02860fc7d1776e9c4b2a4dfb6bebf6d8.poster.avif?t=1787733973\" width=780 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3969340/extras/02860fc7d1776e9c4b2a4dfb6bebf6d8.webm?t=1787733973\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3969340/extras/02860fc7d1776e9c4b2a4dfb6bebf6d8.mp4?t=1787733973\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Ride, drive and fight your way to the final</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Checkpoint courses, show jumps, flag collecting, ring jousting – every discipline brings you closer to the final, and every mistake costs points. Timing, skill and a good sense of direction decide who ends up on the winners’ podium.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3969340/extras/16519197de9462eec801938dce5bb7e2.poster.avif?t=1787733973\" width=780 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3969340/extras/16519197de9462eec801938dce5bb7e2.webm?t=1787733973\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3969340/extras/16519197de9462eec801938dce5bb7e2.mp4?t=1787733973\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>You and your horse – a strong team!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A good competition does not begin at the starting line. Brush your horse, pick out its hooves, feed it and decorate it for the big performance. After tough races, cool it down with water.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>What awaits you:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience an exciting Bibi &amp; Tina adventure – with lots of great tasks and horse-filled moments!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play as Bibi, Tina or Alex – together with Sabrina, Amadeus, Maharaja and seven more horses that you can unlock.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover the special highlight: carriage driving with races and slalom courses.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Train for different tournament disciplines and collect points for the final.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ride checkpoint races, show jumping, slalom, flag races, ring jousting and trail races.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Care for your horse by brushing it, feeding it, picking out its hooves, decorating it and cooling it down.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore familiar places such as Martin's Farm, Falkenstein Castle, the Old Mill, Wolf's Gorge, the forest and Redwell Castle.</p></li></ul>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3969340/extras/6e756e5f6b0a301d3fdab9ff4b68425d.poster.avif?t=1787733973\" width=780 height=150 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3969340/extras/6e756e5f6b0a301d3fdab9ff4b68425d.webm?t=1787733973\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3969340/extras/6e756e5f6b0a301d3fdab9ff4b68425d.mp4?t=1787733973\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Summer holidays? Adventure time!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No sooner has Bibi returned to Martin's Farm than the next big adventure awaits: the Summer Cup is starting at Falkenstein Castle. Together with Tina and Alex, you compete in exciting riding disciplines – and show what friendship, fairness and a little bit of witchcraft can make possible.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3969340/extras/5671bece190a8ed6ea0ee5704540921f.poster.avif?t=1787733973\" width=780 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3969340/extras/5671bece190a8ed6ea0ee5704540921f.webm?t=1787733973\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3969340/extras/5671bece190a8ed6ea0ee5704540921f.mp4?t=1787733973\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>New: carriage driving!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This has never been seen in a Bibi &amp; Tina game before: Bibi, Tina and Alex have their very own vehicle ready for the Summer Cup. Steer a carriage along country tracks, through flower gates and around tight slalom courses! After all, champions do not only prove themselves in the saddle.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3969340/extras/c64b6ddf19e7d1643ce1aec76b787627.poster.avif?t=1787733973\" width=780 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3969340/extras/c64b6ddf19e7d1643ce1aec76b787627.webm?t=1787733973\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3969340/extras/c64b6ddf19e7d1643ce1aec76b787627.mp4?t=1787733973\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Stephanie wants the cup. At any cost.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Good thing you are not on your own. Stephanie von Schotterburg has her very own ideas about how to win – and the closer the final gets, the clearer her intentions become. Now it is time to show what really matters: friendship and sticking together. And, of course, Bibi’s witch power!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3969340/extras/02860fc7d1776e9c4b2a4dfb6bebf6d8.poster.avif?t=1787733973\" width=780 height=300 ><source 