Maharaja and seven more horses that you can unlock.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover the special highlight: carriage driving with races and slalom courses.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Train for different tournament disciplines and collect points for the final.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ride checkpoint races, show jumping, slalom, flag races, ring jousting and trail races.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Care for your horse by brushing it, feeding it, picking out its hooves, decorating it and cooling it down.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore familiar places such as Martin's Farm, Falkenstein Castle, the Old Mill, Wolf's Gorge, the forest and Redwell Castle.</p></li></ul>", "short_description": "A summer full of friendship, tournament excitement and horse-filled happiness: Ride with Bibi, Tina and Alex as they compete for the cup, stand together against unfair rivals – and dive into varied horse-riding adventures. Action-packed carriage races are among the special highlights.", "supported_languages": "English, French, Italian, German, Spanish - Spain, Dutch, Polish, Russian", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3969340/b377c48d4f1195b37c0058d767105066c10924c8/header.jpg?t=1787733973", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3969340/1d97583af40acc5024b6899d17761af78ba32dfb/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1787733973", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3969340/1d97583af40acc5024b6899d17761af78ba32dfb/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1787733973", "website": null, "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10 / 11<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 4 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 11<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 3 GB available space</li></ul>", "recommended": "<strong>Recommended:</strong><b